%% title: Order lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: order created
  Pending --> Paid: charge approved
  Pending --> Failed: declined / timeout
  Failed --> Pending: customer retries
  Paid --> Shipped: label printed
  Shipped --> Delivered: carrier scan
  Paid --> Refunded: refund issued
  Delivered --> Refunded: return accepted
  Delivered --> [*]
  Refunded --> [*]
